                  {
                    "id": "intro-text",
                    "component": "Text",
                    "variant": "body",
                    "text": "South Lake Union is home to some of Seattle's most vibrant coffee spots, ranging from specialized matcha bars to industrial-chic espresso houses. Here are 5 great options to check out:\n\n*   **Matcha Magic SLU**: A quiet, highly-rated cafe known for its unique matcha offerings and pink-and-green aesthetic. Perfect for a calm break or solo work.\n*   **203° Fahrenheit Coffee Company**: A contemporary, trendy spot with a large selection of vegan and vegetarian dishes. It's dog-friendly and features a bright design with outdoor seating.\n*   **Espresso Vivace South Lake Union**: An iconic industrial-chic espresso bar famous for its foam art and high-quality roasts. A popular hub for laptop work.\n*   **Evoke Cafe Bar**: A women-owned, inclusive space offering vegan/vegetarian options and a welcoming vibe for quiet conversation.\n*   **Zoka Coffee**: A casual, contemporary atmosphere serving hand-roasted coffee and housemade baked goods, ideal for dates or remote work."
                  },
